  "worked_solution": "First, we calculate $v(t)$ by differentiating $s(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}s}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t-2\\operatorname{cos}\u2061(2t)) \\\\  & =1+4\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(2t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we differentiate $v(t)$ to find $a(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1+4\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(2t)) \\\\  & =8\\operatorname{cos}\u2061(2t)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
